{#
  «شريط متحرك» — a moving strip of short phrases between Home sections.

  | Variable                   | Type    | Description                                  |
  |----------------------------|---------|----------------------------------------------|
  | component.items[].text     | string  | One phrase                                   |
  | component.items[].url      | ?string | Optional link, from the customiser's picker  |
  | component.separator        | ?string | Between phrases; «✦» when empty              |
  | component.speed            | ?option | slow / normal / fast                         |
  | component.background_color | ?colour | Fills --marquee-bg; the token's when empty   |
  | component.text_color       | ?colour | Fills --marquee-text; the token's when empty |
  | position                   | int     | Sorting number, from zero                    |

  Added at the owner's request on 2026-10-12 — a second strip, separate from the
  announcement bar, holding several phrases. No artboard draws it, so it is the
  announcement bar's own motion (T-3.03) rather than a new one: a track holding
  the phrases twice, moved by half its width, paused on hover and focus, and
  stopped for reduced motion. Recorded in DERIVED-DECISIONS.md.

  THE PHRASES ARE REPEATED INSIDE EACH HALF so that a few short phrases still
  fill a wide screen; with one copy the strip would show a gap before it loops.
  Only the first copy is read by a screen reader — every repeat is aria-hidden,
  so the phrases are announced once however many times they scroll past.
#}
{% set marquee_items = component.items|default([]) %}
{% set marquee_separator = component.separator|default('✦') %}

{# A dropdown's value may be the option's value, the option, or a list of
   options — take the value in every case. #}
{% set marquee_speed = component.speed|default('normal') %}
{% if marquee_speed.value is defined %}
    {% set marquee_speed = marquee_speed.value %}
{% elseif marquee_speed is iterable %}
    {% set marquee_speed = marquee_speed|first %}
    {% if marquee_speed.value is defined %}
        {% set marquee_speed = marquee_speed.value %}
    {% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if marquee_items|length %}
    <section data-testid="store-home-marquee"
             class="s-block marquee marquee--{{ marquee_speed }}"
             style="{% if component.background_color %}--marquee-bg: {{ component.background_color }};{% endif %}{% if component.text_color %}--marquee-text: {{ component.text_color }};{% endif %}">
        <div class="marquee__track">
            {# Eight identical groups: the track moves by half its width, so the
               count must be even for the two halves to match. #}
            {% for copy in [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8] %}
                {% set marquee_is_read = loop.first %}
                <ul class="marquee__group" {% if not marquee_is_read %}aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}>
                    {% for item in marquee_items %}
                        {% if item.text %}
                            <li class="marquee__item">
                                {% if item.url %}
                                    <a class="marquee__link" href="{{ item.url }}" {% if not marquee_is_read %}tabindex="-1"{% endif %}>{{ item.text }}</a>
                                {% else %}
                                    {{ item.text }}
                                {% endif %}
                            </li>
                            <li class="marquee__separator" aria-hidden="true">{{ marquee_separator }}</li>
                        {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </section>
{% endif %}
